                      "maximum": 9007199254740991,
                      "minimum": -9007199254740991,
                      "type": "integer",
                    },
                    "outdated": {
                      "description": "Fyrden: the diff moved on since: the head moved, or for \`LEFT\` the merge base (the base branch can move it with the head unchanged); the lines are those of \`commit_id\` (for \`LEFT\`, of the merge base then).",
                      "type": "boolean",
